.SS broken\-collections\-callable / E6005
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fB\(aqcollections.abc.Callable\(aq inside Optional and Union is broken in 3.9.0 / 3.9.1 (use \(aqtyping.Callable\(aq instead)\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fI\(ga\(gacollections.abc.Callable\(ga\(ga inside Optional and Union is broken in Python 3.9.0 and 3.9.1. Use \(ga\(gatyping.Callable\(ga\(ga for these cases instead. https://bugs.python.org/issue42965\fP
.sp
