.SS broken\-noreturn / E6004
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fB\(aqNoReturn\(aq inside compound types is broken in 3.7.0 / 3.7.1\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fI\(ga\(gatyping.NoReturn\(ga\(ga inside compound types is broken in Python 3.7.0 and 3.7.1. If not dependent on runtime introspection, use string annotation instead. E.g. \(ga\(gaCallable[..., \(aqNoReturn\(aq]\(ga\(ga. https://bugs.python.org/issue34921\fP
.sp
