.SS invalid\-character\-carriage\-return / E2511
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBInvalid unescaped character carriage\-return, use \(dq\er\(dq instead.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIMoves the cursor to the start of line, subsequent characters overwrite the start of the line.\fP
.sp
