.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
This message exists because one of our checkers is very generic, but it\(aqs never going to
raise during normal use as it\(aqs a \fBsyntax\-error\fP that would prevent the python ast
(and thus pylint) from constructing a code representation of the file.
.sp
You could encounter it by feeding a properly constructed node directly to the checker.
