\fIEmitted whenever we can detect that a class is using, as a metaclass, something which might be invalid for using as a metaclass.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
class Apple(metaclass=int):  # [invalid\-metaclass]
    pass

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
