print(fruits[0])

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
Be careful with \fB[True]\fP or \fB[False]\fP as sequence index, since \fBTrue\fP and \fBFalse\fP will respectively
be evaluated as \fB1\fP and \fB0\fP and will bring the second element of the list and the first without erroring.
.sp
