.SS misplaced\-bare\-raise / E0704
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBThe raise statement is not inside an except clause\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when a bare raise is not used inside an except clause. This generates an error, since there are no active exceptions to be reraised. An exception to this rule is represented by a bare raise inside a finally clause, which might work, as long as an exception is raised inside the try block, but it is nevertheless a code smell that must not be relied upon.\fP
.sp
