.SS not\-async\-context\-manager / E1701
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBAsync context manager \(aq%s\(aq doesn\(aqt implement __aenter__ and __aexit__.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when an async context manager is used with an object that does not implement the async context management protocol.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
class ContextManager:
    def __enter__(self):
        pass

    def __exit__(self, *exc):
        pass


async def foo():
    async with ContextManager():  # [not\-async\-context\-manager]
        pass

.EE
