.SS continue\-in\-finally / W0136
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fB\(aqcontinue\(aq discouraged inside \(aqfinally\(aq clause\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when the \(gacontinue\(ga keyword is found inside a finally clause. This will raise a SyntaxWarning starting in Python 3.14.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
while True:
    try:
        pass
    finally:
        continue  # [continue\-in\-finally]

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
while True:
    try:
        pass
    except ValueError:
        pass
    else:
        continue

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
