.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Be careful with exec and eval in Python \%<https://\:lucumr\:.pocoo\:.org/\:2011/\:2/\:1/\:exec-in-python>
.IP \(bu 2
Python documentation \%<https://\:docs\:.python\:.org/\:3/\:library/\:functions\:.html#\:exec>
