.SS forgotten\-debug\-statement / W1515
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBLeaving functions creating breakpoints in production code is not recommended\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fICalls to breakpoint(), sys.breakpointhook() and pdb.set_trace() should be removed from code that is not actively being debugged.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
import pdb


def find_the_treasure(clues):
    for clue in clues:
        pdb.set_trace()  # [forgotten\-debug\-statement]
        if \(dqtreasure\(dq in clue:
            return True
    return False


treasure_hunt = [
    \(dqDead Man\(aqs Chest\(dq,
    \(dqX marks the spot\(dq,
    \(dqThe treasure is buried near the palm tree\(dq,
]
find_the_treasure(treasure_hunt)

.EE
