.SS invalid\-envvar\-default / W1508
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fB%s default type is %s. Expected str or None.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEnv manipulation functions return None or str values. Supplying anything different as a default may cause bugs. See https://docs.python.org/3/library/os.html#os.getenv.\fP
