.SS missing\-timeout / W3101
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBMissing timeout argument for method \(aq%s\(aq can cause your program to hang indefinitely\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when a method needs a \(aqtimeout\(aq parameter in order to avoid waiting for a long time. If no timeout is specified explicitly the default value is used. For example for \(aqrequests\(aq the program will never time out (i.e. hang indefinitely).\fP
.sp
