.SS modified\-iterating\-list / W4701
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBIterated list \(aq%s\(aq is being modified inside for loop body, consider iterating through a copy of it instead.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when items are added or removed to a list being iterated through. Doing so can result in unexpected behaviour, that is why it is preferred to use a copy of the list.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
fruits = [\(dqapple\(dq, \(dqorange\(dq, \(dqmango\(dq]
for fruit in fruits:
    fruits.append(\(dqpineapple\(dq)  # [modified\-iterating\-list]

.EE
