.sp
\fBThe u prefix for strings is no longer necessary in Python >=3.0\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when we detect a string with a u prefix. These prefixes were necessary in Python 2 to indicate a string was Unicode, but since Python 3.0 strings are Unicode by default.\fP
