.SS redundant\-unittest\-assert / W1503
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBRedundant use of %s with constant value %r\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIThe first argument of assertTrue and assertFalse is a condition. If a constant is passed as parameter, that condition will be always true. In this case a warning should be emitted.\fP
.sp
