.SS shallow\-copy\-environ / W1507
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBUsing copy.copy(os.environ). Use os.environ.copy() instead.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIos.environ is not a dict object but proxy object, so shallow copy has still effects on original object. See https://bugs.python.org/issue15373 for reference.\fP
.sp
