.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
By default, this check is skipped for \fB__init__.py\fP files, as they often contain imports from submodules for the convenience of end users. While these imports are not used within \fB__init__.py\fP, they serve the purpose of providing intuitive import paths for the module\(aqs important classes and constants.
