.SS consider\-iterating\-dictionary / C0201
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBConsider iterating the dictionary directly instead of calling .keys()\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when the keys of a dictionary are iterated through the \(ga\(ga.keys()\(ga\(ga method or when \(ga\(ga.keys()\(ga\(ga is used for a membership check. It is enough to iterate through the dictionary itself, \(ga\(gafor key in dictionary\(ga\(ga. For membership checks, \(ga\(gaif key in dictionary\(ga\(ga is faster.\fP
