Created by the refactoring \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:blob/\:main/\:build/\:lib/\:pylint/\:checkers/\:refactoring/\:recommendation_checker\:.py> checker.
.SS consider\-using\-any\-or\-all / C0501
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fB\(gafor\(ga loop could be \(ga%s\(ga\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIA for loop that checks for a condition and return a bool can be replaced with any or all.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.sp
\fBall_even.py\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
def all_even(items):
    \(dq\(dq\(dqReturn True if the list contains all even numbers\(dq\(dq\(dq
    for item in items:  # [consider\-using\-any\-or\-all]
        if not item % 2 == 0:
            return False
    return True

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBany_even.py\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
def any_even(items):
    \(dq\(dq\(dqReturn True if the list contains any even numbers\(dq\(dq\(dq
    for item in items:  # [consider\-using\-any\-or\-all]
        if item % 2 == 0:
            return True
    return False

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.sp
\fBall_even.py\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
def all_even(items):
    \(dq\(dq\(dqReturn True if the list contains all even numbers\(dq\(dq\(dq
    return all(item % 2 == 0 for item in items)

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
