\fBany_even.py\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
def any_even(items):
    \(dq\(dq\(dqReturn True if the list contains any even numbers\(dq\(dq\(dq
    return any(item % 2 == 0 for item in items)

.EE
