Created by the consider\-using\-any\-or\-all \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:blob/\:main/\:build/\:lib/\:pylint/\:extensions/\:for_any_all\:.py> checker.
.SS consider\-using\-dict\-items / C0206
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBConsider iterating with .items()\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when iterating over the keys of a dictionary and accessing the value by index lookup. Both the key and value can be accessed by iterating using the .items() method of the dictionary instead.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
ORCHESTRA = {
    \(dqviolin\(dq: \(dqstrings\(dq,
    \(dqoboe\(dq: \(dqwoodwind\(dq,
    \(dqtuba\(dq: \(dqbrass\(dq,
    \(dqgong\(dq: \(dqpercussion\(dq,
}


for instrument in ORCHESTRA:  # [consider\-using\-dict\-items]
    print(f\(dq{instrument}: {ORCHESTRA[instrument]}\(dq)

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
ORCHESTRA = {
    \(dqviolin\(dq: \(dqstrings\(dq,
    \(dqoboe\(dq: \(dqwoodwind\(dq,
    \(dqtuba\(dq: \(dqbrass\(dq,
    \(dqgong\(dq: \(dqpercussion\(dq,
}


for instrument, section in ORCHESTRA.items():
    print(f\(dq{instrument}: {section}\(dq)

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Created by the refactoring \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:blob/\:main/\:build/\:lib/\:pylint/\:checkers/\:refactoring/\:recommendation_checker\:.py> checker.
.SS consider\-using\-enumerate / C0200
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBConsider using enumerate instead of iterating with range and len\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when code that iterates with range and len is encountered. Such code can be simplified by using the enumerate builtin.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
seasons = [\(dqSpring\(dq, \(dqSummer\(dq, \(dqFall\(dq, \(dqWinter\(dq]

for i in range(len(seasons)):  # [consider\-using\-enumerate]
    print(i, seasons[i])

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
