for i, season in enumerate(seasons):
    print(i, season)

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Created by the refactoring \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:blob/\:main/\:build/\:lib/\:pylint/\:checkers/\:refactoring/\:recommendation_checker\:.py> checker.
.SS consider\-using\-f\-string / C0209
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBFormatting a regular string which could be an f\-string\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when we detect a string that is being formatted with format() or % which could potentially be an f\-string. The use of f\-strings is preferred. Requires Python 3.6 and \(ga\(gapy\-version >= 3.6\(ga\(ga.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
from string import Template

menu = (\(dqeggs\(dq, \(dqspam\(dq, 42.4)

old_order = \(dq%s and %s: %.2f ¤\(dq % menu  # [consider\-using\-f\-string]
beginner_order = menu[0] + \(dq and \(dq + menu[1] + \(dq: \(dq + str(menu[2]) + \(dq ¤\(dq
joined_order = \(dq and \(dq.join(menu[:2])
# +1: [consider\-using\-f\-string]
format_order = \(dq{} and {}: {:0.2f} ¤\(dq.format(menu[0], menu[1], menu[2])
# +1: [consider\-using\-f\-string]
named_format_order = \(dq{eggs} and {spam}: {price:0.2f} ¤\(dq.format(
    eggs=menu[0], spam=menu[1], price=menu[2]
)
template_order = Template(\(dq$eggs and $spam: $price ¤\(dq).substitute(
    eggs=menu[0], spam=menu[1], price=menu[2]
)

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
menu = (\(dqeggs\(dq, \(dqspam\(dq, 42.4)

f_string_order = f\(dq{menu[0]} and {menu[1]}: {menu[2]:0.2f} ¤\(dq

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
Formatted string literals (f\-strings) give a concise, consistent syntax
that can replace most use cases for the \fB%\fP formatting operator,
\fBstr.format()\fP and \fBstring.Template\fP\&.
.sp
F\-strings also perform better than alternatives; see
this tweet \%<https://\:twitter\:.com/\:raymondh/\:status/\:1205969258800275456> for
a simple example.
.sp
Created by the refactoring \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:blob/\:main/\:build/\:lib/\:pylint/\:checkers/\:refactoring/\:recommendation_checker\:.py> checker.
