.SS import\-outside\-toplevel / C0415
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBImport outside toplevel (%s)\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when an import statement is used anywhere other than the module toplevel. Move this import to the top of the file.\fP
.sp
