.SS missing\-function\-docstring / C0116
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBMissing function or method docstring\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when a function or method has no docstring. Some special methods like __init__ do not require a docstring.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
import sys


def print_python_version():  # [missing\-function\-docstring]
    print(sys.version)

.EE
