.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmpty sequences are considered false in a boolean context. Following this check blindly in weakly typed code base can create hard to debug issues. If the value can be something else that is falsey but not a sequence (for example \(ga\(gaNone\(ga\(ga, an empty string, or \(ga\(ga0\(ga\(ga) the code will not be equivalent.\fP
.sp
