.SS use\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-len / C1802
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBDo not use \(galen(SEQUENCE)\(ga without comparison to determine if a sequence is empty\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmpty sequences are considered false in a boolean context. You can either remove the call to \(aqlen\(aq (\(ga\(gaif not x\(ga\(ga) or compare the length against a scalar (\(ga\(gaif len(x) > 1\(ga\(ga).\fP
.sp
