.SS use\-maxsplit\-arg / C0207
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBUse %s instead\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when accessing only the first or last element of str.split(). The first and last element can be accessed by using str.split(sep, maxsplit=1)[0] or str.rsplit(sep, maxsplit=1)[\-1] instead.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
