.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIWhen iterating over values, sequence types (e.g., \(ga\(galists\(ga\(ga, \(ga\(gatuples\(ga\(ga, \(ga\(garanges\(ga\(ga) are more efficient than \(ga\(gasets\(ga\(ga.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
