.SS useless\-import\-alias / C0414
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBImport alias does not rename original package\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIUsed when an import alias is same as original package, e.g., using import numpy as numpy instead of import numpy as np.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
import pandas as pandas  # [useless\-import\-alias]

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
