.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.SS Known issue
.sp
If you prefer to use \(dqfrom\-as\(dq to explicitly reexport in API (\fBfrom fruit import orange as orange\fP)
instead of using \fB__all__\fP this message will be a false positive.
.sp
Use \fB\-\-allow\-reexport\-from\-package\fP to allow explicit reexports by alias
in package \fB__init__\fP files.
.sp
\fBRelated links:\fP
