.SS consider\-swap\-variables / R1712
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBConsider using tuple unpacking for swapping variables\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIYou do not have to use a temporary variable in order to swap variables. Using \(dqtuple unpacking\(dq to directly swap variables makes the intention more clear.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
