.SS consider\-using\-in / R1714
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBConsider merging these comparisons with \(aqin\(aq by using \(aq%s %sin (%s)\(aq. Use a set instead if elements are hashable.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fITo check if a variable is equal to one of many values, combine the values into a set or tuple and check if the variable is contained \(dqin\(dq it instead of checking for equality against each of the values. This is faster and less verbose.\fP
.sp
