.SS match\-class\-bind\-self / R1905
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBUse \(aq%s() as %s\(aq instead\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIMatch class patterns are faster if the name binding happens for the whole pattern and any lookup for \(ga__match_args__\(ga can be avoided.\fP
.sp
\fBProblematic code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
class Book:
    __match_args__ = (\(dqtitle\(dq, \(dqyear\(dq)

    def __init__(self, title, year):
        self.title = title
        self.year = year


def func(item: Book):
    match item:
        case Book(title=str(title)):  # [match\-class\-bind\-self]
            ...
        case Book(year=int(year)):  # [match\-class\-bind\-self]
            ...

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBCorrect code:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
class Book:
    __match_args__ = (\(dqtitle\(dq, \(dqyear\(dq)

    def __init__(self, title, year):
        self.title = title
        self.year = year


def func(item: Book):
    match item:
        case Book(title=str() as title):
            ...
        case Book(year=int() as year):
            ...

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBRelated links:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python documentation \%<https://\:docs\:.python\:.org/\:3/\:reference/\:compound_stmts\:.html#\:class-patterns>
.UNINDENT
.sp
