.SS unnecessary\-default\-type\-args / R6007
.sp
\fBMessage emitted:\fP
.sp
\fBType \(ga%s\(ga has unnecessary default type args. Change it to \(ga%s\(ga.\fP
.sp
\fBDescription:\fP
.sp
\fIEmitted when types have default type args which can be omitted. Mainly used for \(gatyping.Generator\(ga and \(gatyping.AsyncGenerator\(ga.\fP
.sp
