.sp
.EX
[main]
load\-plugins=pylint.extensions.typing

.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
At the moment, this check only works for \fBGenerator\fP and \fBAsyncGenerator\fP\&.
.sp
Starting with Python 3.13, the \fBSendType\fP and \fBReturnType\fP default to \fBNone\fP\&.
As such it\(aqs no longer necessary to specify them. The \fBcollections.abc\fP variants
don\(aqt validate the number of type arguments. Therefore the defaults for these
can be used in earlier versions as well.
.sp
