To make pylint fail for this message use the \fB\-\-fail\-on=I0001\fP option
or \fB\-\-fail\-on=I\fP to fail on all enabled informational messages.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
This warns you that a builtin module was impossible to analyse (an ast node is not pure python).
There\(aqs nothing to change in your code, this is a warning about astroid and pylint\(aqs limitations.
.sp
