.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBAdditional details:\fP
.sp
\fBsuppressed\-message\fP is simply a way to see messages that would be raised
without the disable in your codebase. It should not be activated most
of the time. See also \fBuseless\-suppression\fP if you want to see the message
that are disabled for no reasons.
.sp
Created by the main \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:blob/\:main/\:build/\:lib/\:pylint/\:lint/\:pylinter\:.py> checker.
