.B dict\-init\-mutate (C3401)
\fIDeclare all known key/values when initializing the dictionary.\fP
Dictionaries can be initialized with a single statement using dictionary
literal syntax.
.UNINDENT
.SS Docstyle checker
.sp
This checker is provided by \fBpylint.extensions.docstyle\fP\&.
