\fBpylint.pyreverse.ASTWalker\fP has been removed, as it was only used internally by a single child class.
.sp
Refs #6712
.IP \(bu 2
\fBpyreverse\fP: Resolving and displaying implemented interfaces that are defined by the \fB__implements__\fP
attribute has been deprecated and will be removed in 3.0.
.sp
Refs #6713
.IP \(bu 2
Fix syntax for return type annotations in MermaidJS diagrams produced with \fBpyreverse\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #6467
.IP \(bu 2
Fix type annotations of class and instance attributes using the alternative union syntax in \fBpyreverse\fP diagrams.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBunexpected\-special\-method\-signature\fP false positive for \fB__init_subclass__\fP methods with one or more arguments.
.sp
Closes #6644
.IP \(bu 2
Started ignoring underscore as a local variable for \fBtoo\-many\-locals\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #6488
.IP \(bu 2
Improved wording of the message of \fBdeprecated\-module\fP
.sp
Closes #6169
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPylint\fP now requires Python 3.7.2 or newer to run.
.sp
Closes #4301
.IP \(bu 2
\fBBaseChecker\fP classes now require the \fBlinter\fP argument to be passed.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a failure to respect inline disables for \fBfixme\fP occurring on the last line
of a module when pylint is launched with \fB\-\-enable=fixme\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Update \fBinvalid\-slots\-object\fP message to show bad object rather than its inferred value.
.sp
Closes #6101
.IP \(bu 2
The main checker name is now \fBmain\fP instead of \fBmaster\fP\&. The configuration does not need to be updated as sections\(aq name are optional.
.sp
Closes #5467
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt report \fBuseless\-super\-delegation\fP for the \fB__hash__\fP method in classes that also override the \fB__eq__\fP method.
.sp
Closes #3934
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBtypevar\-name\-mismatch\fP: TypeVar must be assigned to a variable with the same name as its name argument.
.sp
Closes #5224
.IP \(bu 2
Pylint can now be installed with an extra\-require called \fBspelling\fP (\fBpip install pylint[spelling]\fP).
This will add \fBpyenchant\fP to pylint\(aqs dependencies. You will still need to install the
requirements for \fBpyenchant\fP (the \fBenchant\fP library and any dictionaries) yourself. You will also
need to set the \fBspelling\-dict\fP option.
.sp
Refs #6462
.IP \(bu 2
Removed the \fBassign\-to\-new\-keyword\fP message as there are no new keywords in the supported Python
versions any longer.
.sp
Closes #4683
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a crash in the \fBnot\-an\-iterable\fP checker involving multiple starred expressions
inside a call.
.sp
Closes #6372
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a crash in the \fBdocparams\fP extension involving raising the result of a function.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed failure to enable \fBdeprecated\-module\fP after a \fBdisable=all\fP
by making \fBImportsChecker\fP solely responsible for emitting \fBdeprecated\-module\fP instead
of sharing responsibility with \fBStdlibChecker\fP\&. (This could have led to double messages.)
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBno\-init\fP (W0232) warning has been removed. It\(aqs ok to not have an \fB__init__\fP in a class.
.sp
Closes #2409
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBconfig\fP attribute of \fBBaseChecker\fP has been deprecated. You can use \fBchecker.linter.config\fP
to access the global configuration object instead of a checker\-specific object.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBlevel\fP attribute of \fBBaseChecker\fP has been deprecated: everything is now
displayed in \fB\-\-help\fP, all the time.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBoptions_providers\fP attribute of \fBArgumentsManager\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBoption_groups\fP attribute of \fBPyLinter\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
All \fBInterface\fP classes in \fBpylint.interfaces\fP have been deprecated. You can subclass
the respective normal classes to get the same behaviour. The \fB__implements__\fP functionality
was based on a rejected PEP from 2001:
\%<https://\:peps\:.python\:.org/\:pep-0245>
.sp
Closes #2287
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBset_option\fP method of \fBBaseChecker\fP has been deprecated. You can use \fBchecker.linter.set_option\fP
to set an option on the global configuration object instead of a checker\-specific object.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBimplicit\-str\-concat\fP will now be raised on calls like \fBopen(\(dqmyfile.txt\(dq \(dqa+b\(dq)\fP too.
.sp
Closes #6441
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBconfig\fP attribute of \fBPyLinter\fP is now of the \fBargparse.Namespace\fP type instead of
\fBoptparse.Values\fP\&.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBMapReduceMixin\fP has been deprecated. \fBBaseChecker\fP now implements \fBget_map_data\fP and
\fBreduce_map_data\fP\&. If a checker actually needs to reduce data it should define \fBget_map_data\fP
as returning something different than \fBNone\fP and let its \fBreduce_map_data\fP handle a list
of the types returned by \fBget_map_data\fP\&.
An example can be seen by looking at \fBpylint/checkers/similar.py\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBUnsupportedAction\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOptionsManagerMixIn\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOptionParser\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOption\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOptionsProviderMixIn\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBConfigurationMixIn\fP has been deprecated.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBget_global_config\fP has been deprecated. You can now access all global options from
\fBchecker.linter.config\fP\&.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOptionsManagerMixIn\fP has been replaced with \fBArgumentsManager\fP\&. \fBArgumentsManager\fP is considered
private API and most methods that were public on \fBOptionsManagerMixIn\fP have now been deprecated and will
be removed in a future release.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBOptionsProviderMixIn\fP has been replaced with \fBArgumentsProvider\fP\&. \fBArgumentsProvider\fP is considered
private API and most methods that were public on \fBOptionsProviderMixIn\fP have now been deprecated and will
be removed in a future release.
.sp
Refs #5392
.IP \(bu 2
\fBinterfaces.implements\fP has been deprecated and will be removed in 3.0. Please use standard inheritance
patterns instead of \fB__implements__\fP\&.
.sp
Refs #2287
.IP \(bu 2
\fBinvalid\-enum\-extension\fP: Used when a class tries to extend an inherited Enum class.
.sp
Closes #5501
.IP \(bu 2
Added the \fBunrecognized\-option\fP message. Raised if we encounter any unrecognized options.
.sp
Closes #5259
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBtypevar\-double\-variance\fP: The \(dqcovariant\(dq and \(dqcontravariant\(dq keyword arguments
cannot both be set to \(dqTrue\(dq in a TypeVar.
.sp
Closes #5895
.IP \(bu 2
Re\-enable checker \fBbad\-docstring\-quotes\fP for Python <= 3.7.
.sp
Closes #6087
.IP \(bu 2
Removed the broken \fBgenerate\-man\fP option.
.sp
Closes #5283
Closes #1887
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBbad\-string\-format\-type\fP if the value to be formatted is passed in
as a variable holding a constant.
.IP \(bu 2
Add new check \fBunnecessary\-dunder\-call\fP for unnecessary dunder method calls.
.sp
Closes #5936
Closes #6074
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBcache\-max\-size\-none\fP checker has been renamed to \fBmethod\-cache\-max\-size\-none\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5670
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBmethod\-cache\-max\-size\-none\fP checker will now also check \fBfunctools.cache\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5670
.IP \(bu 2
\fBunnecessary\-lambda\-assignment\fP: Lambda expression assigned to a variable.
Define a function using the \(dqdef\(dq keyword instead.
\fBunnecessary\-direct\-lambda\-call\fP: Lambda expression called directly.
Execute the expression inline instead.
.sp
Closes #5976
.IP \(bu 2
\fBpotential\-index\-error\fP: Emitted when the index of a list or tuple exceeds its length.
This checker is currently quite conservative to avoid false positives. We welcome
suggestions for improvements.
.sp
Closes #578
.IP \(bu 2
Added optional extension \fBredefined\-loop\-name\fP to emit messages when a loop variable
is redefined in the loop body.
.sp
Closes #5072
.IP \(bu 2
Changed message type from \fBredefined\-outer\-name\fP to \fBredefined\-loop\-name\fP
(optional extension) for redefinitions of outer loop variables by inner loops.
.sp
Closes #5608
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBignore\-mixin\-members\fP option has been deprecated. You should now use the new
\fBignored\-checks\-for\-mixins\fP option.
.sp
Closes #5205
.IP \(bu 2
\fBbad\-option\-value\fP will be emitted whenever a configuration value or command line invocation
includes an unknown message.
.sp
Closes #4324
.IP \(bu 2
Avoid reporting \fBsuperfluous\-parens\fP on expressions using the \fBis not\fP operator.
.sp
Closes #5930
.IP \(bu 2
Added the \fBsuper\-without\-brackets\fP checker, raised when a super call is missing its brackets.
.sp
Closes #4008
.IP \(bu 2
Added the \fBgenerate\-toml\-config\fP option.
.sp
Refs #5462
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBunnecessary\-list\-index\-lookup\fP for indexing into a list while
iterating over \fBenumerate()\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #4525
.IP \(bu 2
Fix falsely issuing \fBuseless\-suppression\fP on the \fBwrong\-import\-position\fP checker.
.sp
Closes #5219
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive \fBno\-member\fP for Enums with self\-defined members.
.sp
Closes #5138
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBno\-member\fP when attempting to assign an instance
attribute to itself without any prior assignment.
.sp
Closes #1555
.IP \(bu 2
The concept of checker priority has been removed.
.IP \(bu 2
Add a new command line option \fB\-\-minimal\-messages\-config\fP for \fBpytest\fP, which disables all
irrelevant messages when running the functional tests.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBduplicate\-argument\-name\fP now only raises once for each set of duplicated arguments.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug where specifically enabling just \fBawait\-outside\-async\fP was not possible.
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBset_config_directly\fP decorator has been removed.
.IP \(bu 2
Added new message called \fBduplicate\-value\fP which identifies duplicate values inside sets.
.sp
Closes #5880
.IP \(bu 2
Pylint now expands the user path (i.e. \fB~\fP to \fBhome/yusef/\fP) and expands environment variables (i.e. \fBhome/$USER/$project\fP
to \fBhome/yusef/pylint\fP for \fBUSER=yusef\fP and \fBproject=pylint\fP) for pyreverse\(aqs \fBoutput\-directory\fP,
\fBimport\-graph\fP, \fBext\-import\-graph\fP,  \fBint\-import\-graph\fP options, and the spell checker\(aqs \fBspelling\-private\-dict\-file\fP
option.
.sp
Refs #6493
.IP \(bu 2
Created \fBNoSelfUseChecker\fP extension and moved the \fBno\-self\-use\fP check.
You now need to explicitly enable this check using
\fBload\-plugins=pylint.extensions.no_self_use\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5502
.IP \(bu 2
Fix saving of persistent data files in environments where the user\(aqs cache
directory and the linted file are on a different drive.
.sp
Closes #6394
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt emit \fBunsubscriptable\-object\fP for string annotations.
Pylint doesn\(aqt check if class is only generic in type stubs only.
.sp
Closes #4369 and #6523
.IP \(bu 2
Fix pyreverse crash \fBRuntimeError: dictionary changed size during iteration\fP
.sp
Refs #6612
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug where it writes a plain text error message to stdout, invalidating output formats.
.sp
Closes #6597
.IP \(bu 2
\fBis_class_subscriptable_pep585_with_postponed_evaluation_enabled\fP has been deprecated.
Use \fBis_postponed_evaluation_enabled(node) and is_node_in_type_annotation_context(node)\fP
instead.
.sp
Refs #6536
.IP \(bu 2
Update ranges for \fBusing\-constant\-test\fP and \fBmissing\-parentheses\-for\-call\-in\-test\fP
error messages.
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt emit \fBno\-member\fP inside type annotations with
\fBfrom __future__ import annotations\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #6594
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.13
.sp
From pylint\(aqs beginning to pylint 2.14.0 included, we had a changelog that contained \fIall\fP
nontrivial changes to Pylint, including changes that were
not user facing, i.e. change that might interest you only if you\(aqre a developer
working on pylint or pylint plugins or an open\-source historian.
.sp
From pylint 1.6.0 to 2.14.0, on top of the full changelog there was also a summary
of (mostly user facing) changes.
.SS Summary \-\- Release highlights
.sp
In 2.13, we introduced a new check to deal with unicode security issues. On top of that a lot of work was
done inside the unicode checker by @CarliJoy. We also introduced a new check when importing private name
and for unnecessary ellipsis among other.
.sp
We fixed long standing issues related to duplicate code that could not be disabled, line numbers
that were not accurate some of the time, and added the ability to lint all files in a directory without
specifying each one. One of the most anticipated issue from the repository. Thank you @matusvalo !
.sp
A lot of \fBundefined\-variables\fP and \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP issues were resolved thanks to @jacobtylerwalls.
.sp
We started integrating \fBpylint\-error\fP the documentation created by @vald\-phoenix a developer from Hlyniane,
Ukraine. We hope he\(aqs doing well despite the current situation. The deployment is set up but there\(aqs still a lot to do so we welcome any community effort
help to review, integrate, and add good/bad examples \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:issues/\:5953>\&. This should be doable
without any pylint or astroid knowledge, so this is the perfect entrypoint if you want to contribute
to pylint without investing any time learning the internals.
.sp
This release is the last one to support interpreter below 3.7.2, 3.6 end of life was reached in december 2021.
.SS New checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added several checkers to deal with unicode security issues
(see Trojan Sources \%<https://\:trojansource\:.codes> and
PEP 672 \%<https://\:peps\:.python\:.org/\:pep-0672> for details) that also
concern the readability of the code. In detail the following checks were added:
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBbad\-file\-encoding\fP checks that the file is encoded in UTF\-8 as suggested by
PEP8 \%<https://\:peps\:.python\:.org/\:pep-0008/#\:source-file-encoding>\&.
UTF\-16 and UTF\-32 are not supported by Python \%<https://\:bugs\:.python\:.org/\:issue1503789>
at the moment. If this ever changes
\fBinvalid\-unicode\-codec\fP checks that they aren\(aqt used, to allow for backwards
compatibility.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBbidirectional\-unicode\fP checks for bidirectional unicode characters that
could make code execution different than what the user expects.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBinvalid\-character\-backspace\fP, \fBinvalid\-character\-carriage\-return\fP,
\fBinvalid\-character\-sub\fP, \fBinvalid\-character\-esc\fP,
\fBinvalid\-character\-zero\-width\-space\fP and \fBinvalid\-character\-nul\fP
to check for possibly harmful unescaped characters.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Closes #5281
.IP \(bu 2
\fBunnecessary\-ellipsis\fP: Emitted when the ellipsis constant is used unnecessarily.
.sp
Closes #5460
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBtypevar\-name\-missing\-variance\fP\&. Emitted when a covariant
or contravariant \fBTypeVar\fP does not end with  \fB_co\fP or \fB_contra\fP respectively or
when a \fBTypeVar\fP is not either but has a suffix.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBmodified\-iterating\-list\fP, \fBmodified\-iterating\-dict\fP, and \fBmodified\-iterating\-set\fP,
emitted when items are added to or removed from respectively a list, dictionary or
set being iterated through.
.sp
Closes #5348
.IP \(bu 2
Add checker \fBredefined\-slots\-in\-subclass\fP: Emitted when a slot is redefined in a subclass.
.sp
Closes #5617
.IP \(bu 2
.INDENT 2.0
.TP
.B Rewrote Checker of \fBnon\-ascii\-name\fP\&.
It now ensures __all__ Python names are ASCII and also properly
checks the names of imports (\fBnon\-ascii\-module\-import\fP) as
well as file names (\fBnon\-ascii\-file\-name\fP) and emits their respective new warnings.
.sp
Non ASCII characters could be homoglyphs (look alike characters) and hard to
enter on a non specialized keyboard.
See Confusable Characters in PEP 672 \%<https://\:peps\:.python\:.org/\:pep-0672/#\:confusable-characters-in-identifiers>
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBcache\-max\-size\-none\fP checker with checks for the use of \fBfunctools.lru_cache\fP
on class methods with a \fBmaxsize\fP of \fBNone\fP\&. This is unrecommended as it
creates memory leaks by never letting the instance get garbage collected.
.sp
Closes #5670
Closes #6180
.UNINDENT
.SS Removed checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Removed the deprecated \fBcheck_docs\fP extension. You can use the \fBdocparams\fP checker
to get the checks previously included in \fBcheck_docs\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5322
.UNINDENT
.SS Extensions
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New extension \fBimport\-private\-name\fP: indicate imports of external private packages
and objects (prefixed with \fB_\fP). It can be loaded using \fBload\-plugins=pylint.extensions.private_import\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5463
.IP \(bu 2
Pyreverse \- add output in mermaid\-js format and html which is an mermaid js diagram with html boilerplate
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTypingChecker\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added new check \fBbroken\-noreturn\fP to detect broken uses of \fBtyping.NoReturn\fP
if \fBpy\-version\fP is set to Python \fB3.7.1\fP or below.
\%<https://\:bugs\:.python\:.org/\:issue34921>
.IP \(bu 2
Added new check \fBbroken\-collections\-callable\fP to detect broken uses of \fBcollections.abc.Callable\fP
if \fBpy\-version\fP is set to Python \fB3.9.1\fP or below.
\%<https://\:bugs\:.python\:.org/\:issue42965>
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fBDocstringParameterChecker\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed incorrect classification of Numpy\-style docstring as Google\-style docstring for
docstrings with property setter documentation.
Docstring classification is now based on the highest amount of matched sections instead
of the order in which the docstring styles were tried.
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fBDocStringStyleChecker\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Disable checker \fBbad\-docstring\-quotes\fP for Python <= 3.7, because in these versions the line
numbers for decorated functions and classes are not reliable which interferes with the checker.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Closes #3077
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS Other Changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Include \fBtesting_pylintrc\fP in source and wheel distributions.
.sp
Closes #6028
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBunused\-import\fP when disabling both \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP and \fBundefined\-variable\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #6089
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBunnecessary\-ellipsis\fP when using an ellipsis as a default argument.
.sp
Closes #5973
.IP \(bu 2
Add missing dunder methods to \fBunexpected\-special\-method\-signature\fP check.
.IP \(bu 2
No longer emit \fBno\-member\fP in for loops that reference \fBself\fP if the binary operation that
started the for loop uses a \fBself\fP that is encapsulated in tuples or lists.
.sp
Refs pylint\-dev/astroid#1360
Closes #4826
.IP \(bu 2
Fix matching \fB\-\-notes\fP options that end in a non\-word character.
.sp
Closes #5840
.IP \(bu 2
The line numbering for messages related to function arguments is now more accurate. This can
require some message disables to be relocated to updated positions.
.IP \(bu 2
.INDENT 2.0
.TP
.B \fBusing\-f\-string\-in\-unsupported\-version\fP and \fBusing\-final\-decorator\-in\-unsupported\-version\fP msgids
were renamed from \fBW1601\fP and \fBW1602\fP to \fBW2601\fP and \fBW2602\fP\&. Disables using these msgids will break.
This is done in order to restore consistency with the already existing msgids for \fBapply\-builtin\fP and
\fBbasestring\-builtin\fP from the now deleted python 3K+ checker. There is now a check that we\(aqre not using
existing msgids or symbols from deleted checkers.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Closes #5729
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fB\-\-recursive\fP option to allow recursive discovery of all modules and packages in subtree. Running pylint with
\fB\-\-recursive=y\fP option will check all discovered \fB\&.py\fP files and packages found inside subtree of directory provided
as parameter to pylint.
.sp
Closes #352
.IP \(bu 2
Updated the position of messages for class and function definitions to no longer cover
the complete definition. Only the \fBdef\fP or \fBclass\fP + the name of the class/function
are covered.
.sp
Closes #5466
.IP \(bu 2
Reinstated checks from the python3 checker that are still useful for python 3
(\fBeq\-without\-hash\fP). This is now in the \fBpylint.extensions.eq_without_hash\fP optional
extension.
.sp
Closes #5025
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false\-negative for \fBassignment\-from\-none\fP checker with list.sort() method.
.sp
Closes #5722
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBunused\-private\-member\fP false positive when accessing private methods through \fBproperty\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #4756
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash from \fBarguments\-differ\fP and \fBarguments\-renamed\fP when methods were
defined outside the top level of a class.
.sp
Closes #5648
.IP \(bu 2
Better warning messages for useless else or elif when a function returns early.
.sp
Closes #5614
.IP \(bu 2
Asterisks are no longer required in Sphinx and Google style parameter documentation
for \fBmissing\-param\-doc\fP and are parsed correctly.
.sp
Closes #5815
Closes #5406
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed an \fBAstroidError\fP in 2.13.0 raised by the \fB\(gaduplicate\-code\(ga\fP checker with
\fBignore\-imports\fP or \fBignore\-signatures\fP enabled.
.sp
Closes #6301
.IP \(bu 2
Use the \fBtomli\fP package instead of \fBtoml\fP to parse \fB\&.toml\fP files.
.sp
Closes #5885
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive \fBconsider\-using\-dict\-comprehension\fP when creating a dict
using a list of tuples where key AND value vary depending on the same condition.
.sp
Closes #5588
.IP \(bu 2
When run in parallel mode \fBpylint\fP now pickles the data passed to subprocesses with
the \fBdill\fP package. The \fBdill\fP package has therefore been added as a dependency.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive for \fBglobal\-variable\-undefined\fP when \fBglobal\fP is used with a class name
.sp
Closes #3088
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash on properties and inherited class methods when comparing them for
equality against an empty dict.
.sp
Closes #5646
.IP \(bu 2
By default, pylint does no longer take files starting with \fB\&.#\fP into account. Those are
considered Emacs file locks \%<https://\:www\:.gnu\:.org/\:software/\:emacs/\:manual/\:html_node/\:elisp/\:File-Locks\:.html>\&. This behavior can be reverted by redefining the
\fBignore\-patterns\fP option.
.sp
Closes #367
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBsuper\-init\-not\-called\fP when parent or \fBself\fP is a \fBProtocol\fP
.sp
Closes #4790
.IP \(bu 2
The issue template for crashes is now created for crashes which were previously not covered
by this mechanism.
.sp
Closes #5668
.IP \(bu 2
An astroid issue where symlinks were not being taken into account
was fixed
.sp
Closes #1470
Closes #3499
Closes #4302
Closes #4798
Closes #5081
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBundefined\-variable\fP and related variable messages
when the same undefined variable is used as a type annotation and is
accessed multiple times, or is used as a default argument to a function.
.sp
Closes #5399
.IP \(bu 2
Emit \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP instead of \fBundefined\-variable\fP when attempting
to access unused type annotations.
.sp
Closes #5713
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed an issue where \fBungrouped\-imports\fP could not be disabled without raising
\fBuseless\-suppression\fP\&.
.sp
Refs #2366
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a crash on \fB__init__\fP nodes when the attribute was previously uninferable due to a cache
limit size. This limit can be hit when the inheritance pattern of a class (and therefore of the \fB__init__\fP attribute) is very large.
.sp
Closes #5679
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed extremely long processing of long lines with comma\(aqs.
.sp
Closes #5483
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBsuper\-init\-not\-called\fP for classes that inherit their \fBinit\fP from
a parent.
.sp
Closes #4941
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positives for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP from using named
expressions in a ternary operator test and using that expression as
a call argument.
.sp
Closes #5177, #5212
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash with recursion error for inference of class attributes that referenced
the class itself.
.sp
Closes #5408
Refs pylint\-dev/astroid#1392
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive for \fBunused\-argument\fP when a method overridden in a subclass
does nothing with the value of a keyword\-only argument.
.sp
Closes #5771
Refs pylint\-dev/astroid#1382
.IP \(bu 2
Optimize parsing of long lines when \fBmissing\-final\-newline\fP is enabled.
.sp
Closes #5724
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP from a class definition
nested under a function subclassing a class defined outside the function.
.sp
Closes #4590
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBunnecessary_dict_index_lookup\fP false positive when deleting a dictionary\(aqs entry.
.sp
Closes #4716
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP when an except handler
shares a name with a test in a filtered comprehension.
.sp
Closes #5817
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a crash in \fBunused\-private\-member\fP checker when analyzing code using
\fBtype(self)\fP in bound methods.
.sp
Closes #5569
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash in \fBunnecessary\-dict\-index\-lookup\fP checker if the output of
\fBitems()\fP is assigned to a 1\-tuple.
.sp
Closes #5504
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash with slots assignments and annotated assignments.
.sp
Closes #5479
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a crash in \fBunspecified\-encoding\fP checker when providing \fBNone\fP
to the \fBmode\fP argument of an \fBopen()\fP call.
.sp
Closes #5731
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a crash involving a \fBNewType\fP named with an f\-string.
.sp
Closes #5770
Refs pylint\-dev/astroid#1400
.IP \(bu 2
Improved \fBbad\-open\-mode\fP message when providing \fBNone\fP to the \fBmode\fP
argument of an \fBopen()\fP call.
.sp
Closes #5733
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBconsider\-iterating\-dictionary\fP during membership checks encapsulated in iterables
or \fBnot in\fP checks
.sp
Closes #5323
.IP \(bu 2
Allow disabling \fBduplicate\-code\fP with a disable comment when running through
pylint.
.sp
Closes #214
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBundefined\-variable\fP when \fBnamedtuple\fP class
attributes are used as return annotations.
.sp
Closes #5568
.IP \(bu 2
Added confidence level \fBCONTROL_FLOW\fP for warnings relying on assumptions
about control flow.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBused\-before\-assignment\fP now considers that assignments in a try block
may not have occurred when the except or finally blocks are executed.
.sp
Closes #85, #2615
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false negative for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP when a conditional
or context manager intervened before the try statement that suggested
it might fail.
.sp
Closes #4045
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false negative for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP in finally blocks
if an except handler did not define the assignment that might have failed
in the try block.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a false positive for \fBassigning\-non\-slot\fP when the slotted class
defined \fB__setattr__\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #3793
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false positive for \fBinvalid\-class\-object\fP when the object
being assigned to the \fB__class__\fP attribute is uninferable.
.IP \(bu 2
Added a \fBtestutil\fP extra require to the packaging, as \fBgitpython\fP should not be a dependency
all the time but is still required to use the primer helper code in \fBpylint.testutil\fP\&. You can
install it with \fBpip install pylint[testutil]\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5486
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false positive for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP when a named expression
appears as the first value in a container.
.sp
Closes #5112
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP with self\-referential type
annotation in conditional statements within class methods.
.sp
Closes #5499
.IP \(bu 2
\fBused\-before\-assignment\fP now assumes that assignments in except blocks
may not have occurred and warns accordingly.
.sp
Closes #4761
.IP \(bu 2
When evaluating statements after an except block, \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP
assumes that assignments in the except blocks took place if the
corresponding try block contained a return statement.
.sp
Closes #5500
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false negative for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP when some but not all
except handlers defined a name relied upon after an except block when the
corresponding try block contained a return statement.
.sp
Closes #5524
.IP \(bu 2
When evaluating statements in the \fBelse\fP clause of a loop, \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP
assumes that assignments in the except blocks took place if the
except handlers constituted the only ways for the loop to finish without
breaking early.
.sp
Closes #5683
.IP \(bu 2
\fBused\-before\-assignment\fP now checks names in try blocks.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive with \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP for assignment expressions
in lambda statements.
.sp
Closes #5360, #3877
.IP \(bu 2
Improve \fBinvalid\-name\fP check for \fBTypeVar\fP names.
The accepted pattern can be customized with \fB\-\-typevar\-rgx\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #3401
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false positive (affecting unreleased development) for
\fBused\-before\-assignment\fP involving homonyms between filtered comprehensions
and assignments in except blocks.
.sp
Closes #5586
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash on list comprehensions that used \fBtype\fP as inner variable name.
.sp
Closes #5461
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash in \fBuse\-maxsplit\-arg\fP checker when providing the \fBsep\fP argument
to \fBstr.split()\fP by keyword.
.sp
Closes #5737
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBunused\-variable\fP for a comprehension variable matching
an outer scope type annotation.
.sp
Closes #5326
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBundefined\-variable\fP for a variable used multiple times
in a comprehension matching an unused outer scope type annotation.
.sp
Closes #5654
.IP \(bu 2
Require Python \fB3.6.2\fP to run pylint.
.sp
Closes #5065
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash on uninferable decorators on Python 3.6 and 3.7
.IP \(bu 2
Emit \fBredefined\-outer\-name\fP when a nested except handler shadows an outer one.
.sp
Closes #4434
Closes #5370
.IP \(bu 2
\fBencoding\fP can now be supplied as a positional argument to calls that open
files without triggering \fBunspecified\-encoding\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5638
.IP \(bu 2
Fatal errors now emit a score of 0.0 regardless of whether the linted module
contained any statements
.sp
Closes #5451
.IP \(bu 2
\fBfatal\fP was added to the variables permitted in score evaluation expressions.
.IP \(bu 2
The default score evaluation now uses a floor of 0.
.sp
Closes #2399
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBcomparison\-with\-callable\fP false positive for callables that raise, such
as typing constants.
.sp
Closes #5557
.IP \(bu 2
When invoking \fBpylint\fP, \fBepylint\fP, \fBsymilar\fP or \fBpyreverse\fP by importing them in a python file
you can now pass an \fBargv\fP keyword besides patching \fBsys.argv\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5320
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBPyLinter\fP class will now be initialized with a \fBTextReporter\fP
as its reporter if none is provided.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBnot\-callable\fP with attributes that alias \fBNamedTuple\fP
.sp
Fixes part of #1730
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBtestutils\fP for unittests now accept \fBend_lineno\fP and \fBend_column\fP\&. Tests
without these will trigger a \fBDeprecationWarning\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBarguments\-differ\fP will no longer complain about method redefinitions with extra parameters
that have default values.
.sp
Closes #1556, #5338
.IP \(bu 2
Disables for \fBdeprecated\-module\fP and similar warnings for stdlib features deprecated
in newer versions of Python no longer raise \fBuseless\-suppression\fP when linting with
older Python interpreters where those features are not yet deprecated.
.IP \(bu 2
Importing the deprecated stdlib module \fBxml.etree.cElementTree\fP now emits \fBdeprecated_module\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5862
.IP \(bu 2
Importing the deprecated stdlib module \fBdistutils\fP now emits \fBdeprecated_module\fP on Python 3.10+.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive \fBunexpected\-keyword\-arg\fP for decorators.
.sp
Closes #258
.IP \(bu 2
\fBmissing\-raises\-doc\fP will now check the class hierarchy of the raised exceptions
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
def my_function():
  \(dq\(dq\(dqMy function.

  Raises:
    Exception: if something fails
  \(dq\(dq\(dq
  raise ValueError
.EE
