.sp
Closes #6366
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP for assignments taking place via
nonlocal declarations after an earlier type annotation.
.sp
Closes #5394
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false positive for \fBunused\-variable\fP when a builtin specified in
