.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.13.6?
.sp
Release date: 2022\-04\-20
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a crash in the \fBunsupported\-membership\-test\fP checker when assigning
multiple constants to class attributes including \fB__iter__\fP via unpacking.
.sp
Closes #6366
.IP \(bu 2
Asterisks are no longer required in Sphinx and Google style parameter documentation
for \fBmissing\-param\-doc\fP and are parsed correctly.
.sp
Closes #5815
Closes #5406
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false positive for \fBunused\-variable\fP when a builtin specified in
\fB\-\-additional\-builtins\fP is given a type annotation.
.sp
Closes #6388
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed an \fBAstroidError\fP in 2.13.0 raised by the \fBduplicate\-code\fP checker with
\fBignore\-imports\fP or \fBignore\-signatures\fP enabled.
.sp
Closes #6301
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.13.5?
.sp
Release date: 2022\-04\-06
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive regression in 2.13.0 for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP for
homonyms between variable assignments in try/except blocks and variables in
subscripts in comprehensions.
.sp
Closes #6069
Closes #6136
.IP \(bu 2
\fBlru\-cache\-decorating\-method\fP has been renamed to \fBcache\-max\-size\-none\fP and
will only be emitted when \fBmaxsize\fP is \fBNone\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #6180
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBunused\-import\fP when disabling both \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP and \fBundefined\-variable\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #6089
.IP \(bu 2
Narrow the scope of the \fBunnecessary\-ellipsis\fP checker to:
* functions & classes which contain both a docstring and an ellipsis.
* A body which contains an ellipsis \fBnodes.Expr\fP node & at least one other statement.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP for assignments taking place via
nonlocal declarations after an earlier type annotation.
.sp
Closes #5394
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash for \fBredefined\-slots\-in\-subclass\fP when the type of the slot is not a const or a string.
.sp
Closes #6100
.IP \(bu 2
Only raise \fBnot\-callable\fP when all the inferred values of a property are not callable.
.sp
Closes #5931
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a false negative for \fBsubclassed\-final\-class\fP when a set of other messages were disabled.
