Closes #5323
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed crash on uninferable decorators on Python 3.6 and 3.7
.IP \(bu 2
Add checker \fBunnecessary\-ellipsis\fP: Emitted when the ellipsis constant is used unnecessarily.
.sp
Closes #5460
.IP \(bu 2
Disable checker \fBbad\-docstring\-quotes\fP for Python <= 3.7, because in these versions the line
numbers for decorated functions and classes are not reliable which interferes with the checker.
.sp
Closes #3077
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed incorrect classification of Numpy\-style docstring as Google\-style docstring for
docstrings with property setter documentation.
Docstring classification is now based on the highest amount of matched sections instead
of the order in which the docstring styles were tried.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed detection of \fBarguments\-differ\fP when superclass static
methods lacked a \fB@staticmethod\fP decorator.
.sp
Closes #5371
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTypingChecker\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added new check \fBbroken\-noreturn\fP to detect broken uses of \fBtyping.NoReturn\fP
if \fBpy\-version\fP is set to Python \fB3.7.1\fP or below.
\%<https://\:bugs\:.python\:.org/\:issue34921>
.IP \(bu 2
Added new check \fBbroken\-collections\-callable\fP to detect broken uses of \fBcollections.abc.Callable\fP
if \fBpy\-version\fP is set to Python \fB3.9.1\fP or below.
\%<https://\:bugs\:.python\:.org/\:issue42965>
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBtestutils\fP for unittests now accept \fBend_lineno\fP and \fBend_column\fP\&. Tests
without these will trigger a \fBDeprecationWarning\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBarguments\-differ\fP will no longer complain about method redefinitions with extra parameters
that have default values.
.sp
Closes #1556, #5338
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed false positive \fBunexpected\-keyword\-arg\fP for decorators.
.sp
Closes #258
.IP \(bu 2
Importing the deprecated stdlib module \fBxml.etree.cElementTree\fP now emits \fBdeprecated_module\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5862
.IP \(bu 2
Disables for \fBdeprecated\-module\fP and similar warnings for stdlib features deprecated
in newer versions of Python no longer raise \fBuseless\-suppression\fP when linting with
older Python interpreters where those features are not yet deprecated.
.IP \(bu 2
Importing the deprecated stdlib module \fBdistutils\fP now emits \fBdeprecated_module\fP on Python 3.10+.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBmissing\-raises\-doc\fP will now check the class hierarchy of the raised exceptions
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
def my_function():
  \(dq\(dq\(dqMy function.

  Raises:
    Exception: if something fails
  \(dq\(dq\(dq
  raise ValueError
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Closes #4955
.IP \(bu 2
Disable spellchecking of mypy rule names in ignore directives.
.sp
Closes #5929
.IP \(bu 2
Allow disabling \fBduplicate\-code\fP with a disable comment when running through
pylint.
.sp
Closes #214
.IP \(bu 2
Improve \fBinvalid\-name\fP check for \fBTypeVar\fP names.
The accepted pattern can be customized with \fB\-\-typevar\-rgx\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #3401
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBtypevar\-name\-missing\-variance\fP\&. Emitted when a covariant
or contravariant \fBTypeVar\fP does not end with  \fB_co\fP or \fB_contra\fP respectively or
when a \fBTypeVar\fP is not either but has a suffix.
.IP \(bu 2
Allow usage of mccabe 0.7.x release
.sp
Closes #5878
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBunused\-private\-member\fP false positive when accessing private methods through \fBproperty\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #4756
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.12
.sp
From pylint\(aqs beginning to pylint 2.14.0 included, we had a changelog that contained \fIall\fP
nontrivial changes to Pylint, including changes that were
not user facing, i.e. change that might interest you only if you\(aqre a developer
working on pylint or pylint plugins or an open\-source historian.
.sp
From pylint 1.6.0 to 2.14.0, on top of the full changelog there was also a summary
of (mostly user facing) changes.
.SS Summary \-\- Release highlights
.sp
In 2.12, we introduced a new option \fBpy\-version\fP that permits to analyse code for a python
version that may differ from your current python interpreter. This does not affect all checkers but
permits, for example, to check for python 3.5 code smells (using f\-string\(aqs) while using pylint with python 3.6.
The minimum version to run pylint is now 3.6.2, while the last working version for python 3.6.0
and 3.6.1 was pylint 2.9.3.
.sp
On top of fixing a lot of false positives and bugs, we also added new default checks, like
\fBuse\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-comparison\fP, \fBoverridden\-final\-method\fP, and \fBuseless\-with\-lock\fP\&.
There\(aqs also better check for TOML configurations.
.sp
Lastly, in addition to the information we already had about start line and start column,
we introduced new information about the end line and end column of messages. This
will permit to have more precise visual clue in IDE like in pylint for vs\-code. The default
will stay the same to not break compatibility but it can be retrieved by adding \fBend_line\fP
and \fBend_column\fP to the \fB\-\-msg\-template\fP option. For better result stick to python 3.8+.
.sp
The checker for Yoda conditions is now an extension, you might want to enable it if you were
relying on this check. There\(aqs also a new extension checker, \fBconsider\-using\-any\-or\-all\fP that
detects for loops that could be replaced by any or all, entirely contributed by @areveny,
welcome to the team !
.SS New checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBmissing\-any\-param\-doc\fP triggered when a function has neither parameter nor parameter type
documentation. Undocumented parameters are now being properly identified. A warning might start to
appear unexpectedly if \fBmissing\-param\-doc\fP and \fBmissing\-type\-doc\fP were disabled, as a new message
\fBmissing\-any\-param\-doc\fP will be emitted instead.
.sp
Closes #3799
.UNINDENT
.SS typing.final
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBoverridden\-final\-method\fP: Emitted when a method which is annotated with \fBtyping.final\fP is overridden
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBsubclassed\-final\-class\fP: Emitted when a class which is annotated with \fBtyping.final\fP is subclassed
.sp
Closes #3197
.IP \(bu 2
Created new \fBUnsupportedVersionChecker\fP checker class that includes checks for features
not supported by all versions indicated by a \fBpy\-version\fP\&.
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBusing\-f\-string\-in\-unsupported\-version\fP checker. Issued when \fBpy\-version\fP
is set to a version that does not support f\-strings (< 3.6)
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBuse\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-comparison\fP: Emitted when
collection literal comparison is being used to check for emptiness.
.sp
Closes #4774
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBusing\-final\-decorator\-in\-unsupported\-version\fP checker. Issued when \fBpy\-version\fP
is set to a version that does not support typing.final (< 3.8)
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBuseless\-with\-lock\fP to find incorrect usage of with statement and threading module locks.
Emitted when \fBwith threading.Lock():\fP is used instead of \fBwith lock_instance:\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5208
.IP \(bu 2
A new \fBbad\-configuration\-section\fP checker was added that will emit for misplaced option
in pylint\(aqs top level namespace for toml configuration. Top\-level dictionaries or option defined
in the wrong section will still silently not be taken into account, which is tracked in a
follow\-up issue.
.sp
Follow\-up in #5259
.IP \(bu 2
\fBMessageTest\fP of the unittest \fBtestutil\fP now requires the \fBconfidence\fP attribute
to match the expected value. If none is provided it is set to \fBUNDEFINED\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBadd_message\fP of the unittest \fBtestutil\fP now actually handles the \fBcol_offset\fP parameter
and allows it to be checked against actual output in a test.
.UNINDENT
.SS Extensions
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added an optional extension \fBconsider\-using\-any\-or\-all\fP: Emitted when a \fBfor\fP loop only
produces a boolean and could be replaced by \fBany\fP or \fBall\fP using a generator. Also suggests
a suitable any/all statement if it is concise.
.sp
Closes #5008
.IP \(bu 2
Moved \fBmisplaced\-comparison\-constant\fP to its own extension \fBcomparison_placement\fP\&.
This checker was opinionated and now no longer a default. It can be reactived by adding
\fBpylint.extensions.comparison_placement\fP to \fBload\-plugins\fP in your config.
.sp
Closes #1064
.UNINDENT
.SS Other Changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBinstall graphiz\fP message which isn\(aqt needed for puml output format.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBpylint\fP no longer crashes when checking assignment expressions within if\-statements
.sp
Closes #5178
.IP \(bu 2
Added configuration option \fBexclude\-too\-few\-public\-methods\fP to allow excluding
classes from the \fBmin\-public\-methods\fP checker.
.sp
Closes #3370
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBaccept\-no\-yields\-doc\fP and \fBaccept\-no\-return\-doc\fP not allowing missing \fByield\fP or
\fBreturn\fP documentation when a docstring is partially correct
.sp
Closes #5223
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBsimplify\-boolean\-expression\fP when condition can be inferred as False.
.sp
Closes #5200
.IP \(bu 2
Fix exception when pyreverse parses \fBproperty function\fP of a class.
.IP \(bu 2
Improve and flatten \fBunused\-wildcard\-import\fP message
.sp
Closes #3859
.IP \(bu 2
In length checker, \fBlen\-as\-condition\fP has been renamed as
\fBuse\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-len\fP in order to be consistent with
\fBuse\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-comparison\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed \fBprotected\-access\fP for accessing of attributes and methods of inner classes
.sp
Closes #3066
.IP \(bu 2
Update \fBliteral\-comparison\(ga\fP checker to ignore tuple literals
.sp
Closes #3031
.IP \(bu 2
The functional \fBtestutils\fP now accept \fBend_lineno\fP and \fBend_column\fP\&. Expected
output files without these will trigger a \fBDeprecationWarning\fP\&. Expected output files
can be easily updated with the \fBpython tests/test_functional.py \-\-update\-functional\-output\fP command.
.IP \(bu 2
The functional \fBtestutils\fP now correctly check the distinction between \fBHIGH\fP and
\fBUNDEFINED\fP confidence. Expected output files without defined \fBconfidence\fP levels will now
trigger a \fBDeprecationWarning\fP\&. Expected output files can be easily updated with the
\fBpython tests/test_functional.py \-\-update\-functional\-output\fP command.
.IP \(bu 2
The functional test runner now supports the option \fBmin_pyver_end_position\fP to control on which python
versions the \fBend_lineno\fP and \fBend_column\fP attributes should be checked. The default value is 3.8.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBundefined\-variable\fP now correctly flags variables which only receive a type annotations
and never get assigned a value
.sp
Closes #5140
.IP \(bu 2
\fBundefined\-variable\fP now correctly considers the line numbering and order of classes
used in metaclass declarations
.sp
Closes #4031
.IP \(bu 2
\fBused\-before\-assignment\fP now correctly considers references to classes as type annotation
or default values in first\-level methods
.sp
Closes #3771
.IP \(bu 2
\fBundefined\-variable\fP and \fBunused\-variable\fP now correctly trigger for assignment expressions
in functions defaults
.sp
Refs #3688
.IP \(bu 2
\fBself\-cls\-assignment\fP now also considers tuple assignment
.IP \(bu 2
\fBundefined\-variable\fP now correctly triggers for assignment expressions in if ... else statements
This includes a basic form of control flow inference for if ... else statements using
constant boolean values
.sp
Closes #3688
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash for \fBunused\-private\-member\fP when checking private members on \fB__class__\fP
.sp
Closes #5261
.IP \(bu 2
Fix double emitting of \fBnot\-callable\fP on inferable \fBproperties\fP
.sp
Closes #4426
.IP \(bu 2
Support configuring mixin class pattern via \fBmixin\-class\-rgx\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Normalize the input to the \fBignore\-paths\fP option to allow both Posix and
Windows paths
.sp
Closes #5194
.IP \(bu 2
\fBmissing\-param\-doc\fP now correctly parses asterisks for variable length and
keyword parameters
.sp
Closes #3733
.IP \(bu 2
\fBmissing\-param\-doc\fP now correctly handles Numpy parameter documentation without
explicit typing
.sp
Closes #5222
.IP \(bu 2
The \fB\-\-jobs\fP parameter now falls back to 1 if the host operating system does not
have functioning shared semaphore implementation.
.sp
Closes #5216
.IP \(bu 2
Crashes when a list is encountered in a toml configuration do not happen anymore.
.sp
Closes #4580
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash for \fBprotected\-access\fP on (outer) class traversal
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBuseless\-super\-delegation\fP false positive when default keyword argument is a variable.
.IP \(bu 2
Make yn validator case insensitive, to allow for \fBTrue\fP and \fBFalse\fP in config files.
.IP \(bu 2
The last version compatible with python \(aq3.6.0\(aq and \(aq3.6.1\(aq is pylint \(aq2.9.3\(aq. We did not
realize that when adding incompatible typing at the time, and all versions since are broken
for this interpreter. 2.12.0 meta\-information will permit to download pylint on those
interpreters but the installation will fail and tell you to install \(aq2.9.3\(aq instead.
pylint 2.12.1 will require python >= 3.6.2.
.sp
Closes #5171
Follow\-up in #5065
.IP \(bu 2
Added the \fB\-\-enable\-all\-extensions\fP command line option. It will load all available extensions
which can be listed by running \fB\-\-list\-extensions\fP
.IP \(bu 2
It is now recommended to do \fBpylint\fP development on \fBPython\fP 3.8 or higher. This
allows using the latest \fBast\fP parser.
.IP \(bu 2
All standard jobs in the \fBpylint\fP CI now run on \fBPython\fP 3.8 by default. We still
support python 3.6 and 3.7 and run tests for those interpreters.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash on \fBopen()\fP calls when the \fBmode\fP argument is not a simple string.
.sp
Fixes part of #5321
.IP \(bu 2
Add ability to add \fBend_line\fP and \fBend_column\fP to the \fB\-\-msg\-template\fP option.
With the standard \fBTextReporter\fP this will add the line and column number of the
end of a node to the output of Pylint. If these numbers are unknown, they are represented
by an empty string.
.IP \(bu 2
Introduced primer tests and a configuration tests framework. The helper classes available in
\fBpylint/testutil/\fP are still unstable and might be modified in the near future.
.sp
Closes #4412 #5287
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBendLine\fP and \fBendColumn\fP keys to output of \fBJSONReporter\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5380
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBconsider\-iterating\-dictionary\fP during membership checks encapsulated in iterables
or \fBnot in\fP checks
.sp
Closes #5323
.UNINDENT
.SS Full changelog
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.12.2?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-11\-25
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false positive for \fBunused\-import\fP where everything
was not analyzed properly inside typing guards.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a false\-positive regression for \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP for
typed variables in the body of class methods that reference the same class
.sp
Closes #5342
.IP \(bu 2
Specified that the \fBignore\-paths\fP option considers \(dq\(dq to represent a
windows directory delimiter instead of a regular expression escape
character.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed a crash with the \fBignore\-paths\fP option when invoking the option
via the command line.
.sp
Closes #5437
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed handling of Sphinx\-style parameter docstrings with asterisks. These
should be escaped with by prepending a \(dq\(dq.
.sp
Closes #5406
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBendLine\fP and \fBendColumn\fP keys to output of \fBJSONReporter\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5380
.IP \(bu 2
Fixed handling of Google\-style parameter specifications where descriptions
are on the line following the parameter name. These were generating
false positives for \fBmissing\-param\-doc\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5452
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBconsider\-iterating\-dictionary\fP during membership checks encapsulated in iterables
or \fBnot in\fP checks
.sp
Closes #5323
.IP \(bu 2
\fBunused\-import\fP now check all ancestors for typing guards
.sp
Closes #5316
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.12.1?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-11\-25
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Require Python \fB3.6.2\fP to run pylint.
.sp
Closes #5065
