Added support for \fBModuleNotFoundError\fP (\fBimport\-error\fP and \fBno\-name\-in\-module\fP).
\fBModuleNotFoundError\fP inherits from \fBImportError\fP and was added in Python \fB3.6\fP
.IP \(bu 2
\fBundefined\-variable\fP now correctly flags variables which only receive a type annotations
and never get assigned a value
