Improve and flatten \fBunused\-wildcard\-import\fP message
.sp
Closes #3859
.IP \(bu 2
In length checker, \fBlen\-as\-condition\fP has been renamed as
\fBuse\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-len\fP in order to be consistent with
\fBuse\-implicit\-booleaness\-not\-comparison\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Created new \fBUnsupportedVersionChecker\fP checker class that includes checks for features
not supported by all versions indicated by a \fBpy\-version\fP\&.
