Closes #4426
.IP \(bu 2
\fBself\-cls\-assignment\fP now also considers tuple assignment
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBmissing\-function\-docstring\fP not being able to check \fB__init__\fP and other
magic methods even if the \fBno\-docstring\-rgx\fP setting was set to do so
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBusing\-final\-decorator\-in\-unsupported\-version\fP checker. Issued when \fBpy\-version\fP
is set to a version that does not support \fBtyping.final\fP (< 3.8)
.IP \(bu 2
Added configuration option \fBexclude\-too\-few\-public\-methods\fP to allow excluding
classes from the \fBmin\-public\-methods\fP checker.
.sp
Closes #3370
.IP \(bu 2
The \fB\-\-jobs\fP parameter now fallbacks to 1 if the host operating system does not
have functioning shared semaphore implementation.
.sp
Closes #5216
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash for \fBunused\-private\-member\fP when checking private members on \fB__class__\fP
.sp
Closes #5261
.IP \(bu 2
Crashes when a list is encountered in a toml configuration do not happen anymore.
.sp
Closes #4580
.IP \(bu 2
Moved \fBmisplaced\-comparison\-constant\fP to its own extension \fBcomparison_placement\fP\&.
This checker was opinionated and now no longer a default. It can be reactived by adding
\fBpylint.extensions.comparison_placement\fP to \fBload\-plugins\fP in your config.
.sp
Closes #1064
.IP \(bu 2
A new \fBbad\-configuration\-section\fP checker was added that will emit for misplaced option
in pylint\(aqs top level namespace for toml configuration. Top\-level dictionaries or option defined
in the wrong section will still silently not be taken into account, which is tracked in a
follow\-up issue.
.sp
Follow\-up in #5259
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash for \fBprotected\-access\fP on (outer) class traversal
.IP \(bu 2
Added new checker \fBuseless\-with\-lock\fP to find incorrect usage of with statement and threading module locks.
Emitted when \fBwith threading.Lock():\fP is used instead of \fBwith lock_instance:\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #5208
.IP \(bu 2
Make yn validator case insensitive, to allow for \fBTrue\fP and \fBFalse\fP in config files.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash on \fBopen()\fP calls when the \fBmode\fP argument is not a simple string.
.sp
Fixes part of #5321
.IP \(bu 2
Inheriting from a class that implements \fB__class_getitem__\fP no longer raises \fBinherit\-non\-class\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Pyreverse \- Add the project root directory to sys.path
.sp
Closes #2479
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt emit \fBconsider\-using\-f\-string\fP if \fBpy\-version\fP is set to Python < \fB3.6\fP\&.
\fBf\-strings\fP were added in Python \fB3.6\fP
