.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.11
.sp
From pylint\(aqs beginning to pylint 2.14.0 included, we had a changelog that contained \fIall\fP
nontrivial changes to Pylint, including changes that were
not user facing, i.e. change that might interest you only if you\(aqre a developer
working on pylint or pylint plugins or an open\-source historian.
.sp
From pylint 1.6.0 to 2.14.0, on top of the full changelog there was also a summary
of (mostly user facing) changes.
.SS Summary \-\- Release highlights
.sp
In 2.11, we added a new default checker to advise using f\-string as it\(aqs
the most efficient way of formatting strings right now. You can use
pyupgrade \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:asottile/\:pyupgrade>, ruff \%<https://\:docs\:.astral\:.sh/\:ruff> or flynt \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:ikamensh/\:flynt> to migrate your old \fB%\fP and \fBformat()\fP automatically.
.sp
We added a new extension \fBSetMembershipChecker\fP that will advise the
use of set for membership test, as it\(aqs more performant than lists or tuples.
The \fBCodeStyleChecker\fP also got some love, check it out if you\(aqre not already
using it.
.sp
We fixed some long standing bugs, false positives, or false negatives and
we added small quality of life options like \fBmin\-similarity\-lines\fP that
disable the duplication check when set to 0.
.sp
Under the hood the code for both pylint and astroid is progressively more typed,
which could be helpful to you if you\(aqre using them as libraries. In order for
this new typing to make more sense and stay simple, we deprecated some functions
or type that will be removed in the next major version. This is an ongoing effort.
.sp
The future \fBpossible\-forgotten\-f\-prefix\fP check still had too much false positives,
and is delayed again. Check the possible\-forgotten\-f\-prefix \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:pull/\:4787> issue if you want
to provide knowledge or use case :)
.SS New checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBconsider\-using\-f\-string\fP: Emitted when .format() or \(aq%\(aq is being used to format a string.
.sp
Closes #3592
.UNINDENT
.SS Removed checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
The python3 porting mode checker and its \fBpy3k\fP option were removed. You can still find it in older pylint
versions.
.UNINDENT
.SS Extensions
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added new extension \fBSetMembershipChecker\fP with \fBuse\-set\-for\-membership\fP check:
Emitted when using an in\-place defined \fBlist\fP or \fBtuple\fP to do a membership test. \fBsets\fP are better optimized for that.
.sp
Closes #4776
.UNINDENT
.SS CodeStyleChecker
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBconsider\-using\-assignment\-expr\fP: Emitted when an assignment is directly followed by an if statement
and both can be combined by using an assignment expression \fB:=\fP\&. Requires Python 3.8
.sp
Closes #4862
.UNINDENT
.SS Other Changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBpy\-version\fP config key (if \fB[MAIN]\fP section). Used for version dependent checks.
Will default to whatever Python version pylint is executed with.
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBinvalid\-name\fP message is now more detailed when using multiple naming style regexes.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBconsider\-using\-with\fP if a context manager is assigned to a
variable in different paths of control flow (e. g. if\-else clause).
.sp
Closes #4751
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBfunction\-redefined\fP for simple type annotations
.sp
Closes #4936
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBprotected\-access\fP if a protected member is used in type hints of function definitions
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBdict\-iter\-missing\-items\fP for dictionaries only using tuples as keys
.sp
Closes #3282
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBunspecified\-encoding\fP checker now also checks calls to \fBpathlib.Path().read_text()\fP
and \fBpathlib.Path().write_text()\fP
.sp
Closes #4945
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBsuperfluous\-parens\fP for tuples created with inner tuples
.sp
Closes #4907
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBunused\-private\-member\fP for accessing attributes in a class using \fBcls\fP
.sp
Closes #4849
.IP \(bu 2
Extended \fBconsider\-using\-in\fP check to work for attribute access.
.IP \(bu 2
Setting \fBmin\-similarity\-lines\fP to 0 now makes the similarty checker stop checking for duplicate code
.sp
Closes #4901
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a bug where pylint complained if the cache\(aqs parent directory does not exist
.sp
Closes #4900
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBglobal\-variable\-not\-assigned\fP checker now catches global variables that are never reassigned in a
local scope and catches (reassigned) functions
.sp
Closes #1375
Closes #330
.IP \(bu 2
The \fBconsider\-iterating\-dictionary\fP checker now also considers membership checks
.sp
Closes #4069
.UNINDENT
.SS Full changelog
