.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.11.0?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-09\-16
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
The python3 porting mode checker and its \fBpy3k\fP option were removed. You can still find it in older pylint
versions.
