.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New In Pylint 2.10
.sp
From pylint\(aqs beginning to pylint 2.14.0 included, we had a changelog that contained \fIall\fP
nontrivial changes to Pylint, including changes that were
not user facing, i.e. change that might interest you only if you\(aqre a developer
working on pylint or pylint plugins or an open\-source historian.
.sp
From pylint 1.6.0 to 2.14.0, on top of the full changelog there was also a summary
of (mostly user facing) changes.
.SS Summary \-\- Release highlights
.sp
In 2.10, we added several new default check, like \fBunspecified\-encoding\fP, \fBforgotten\-debug\-statement\fP or
\fBuse\-dict\-literal\fP\&. There\(aqs also a few opinionated optional one. You can now forbid while loop or
profess your exclusive love of ternary expressions publicly. We promise you hours of arguing fun with
your whole team if you add those to your configuration.
.sp
We\(aqve also fixed some long standing bugs, false positives, or missing options like \fBignore\-signature\fP that
will now work on inner function\(aqs signatures.
.sp
A new option to disable the next line, \fBdisable\-next\fP, has been added. It\(aqs also possible to export
colored diagrams, and plantuml diagram using pyreverse. \fBPYLINT_HOME\fP is now \fBXDG_CACHE_HOME\fP if not set.
.sp
The performance of the similarity checker has been improved, as well as several small performance fixes.
.sp
We\(aqre going to continue working on improving performance during 2.11. We\(aqre also going to finalize
a new \fBpossible\-forgotten\-f\-prefix\fP check that had too much false positives at release time.
Check the possible\-forgotten\-f\-prefix \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:pylint-dev/\:pylint/\:pull/\:4787> issue if you want to provide knowledge or use case :)
.SS New checkers
