Closes #4368
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false\-positive of \fBunused\-private\-member\fP when using \fB__new__\fP in a class
.sp
Closes #4668
.IP \(bu 2
No longer emit \fBconsider\-using\-with\fP for \fBThreadPoolExecutor\fP and \fBProcessPoolExecutor\fP
as they have legitimate use cases without a \fBwith\fP block.
.sp
Closes #4689
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash when inferring variables assigned in match patterns
