.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.9.0?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-06\-29
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.10 is now supported.
.IP \(bu 2
Add type annotations to pyreverse dot files
.sp
Closes #1548
.IP \(bu 2
Fix missing support for detecting deprecated aliases to existing
functions/methods.
.sp
Closes #4618
.IP \(bu 2
astroid has been upgraded to 2.6.1
.IP \(bu 2
Added various deprecated functions/methods for python 3.10, 3.7, 3.6 and 3.3
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBuseless\-type\-doc\fP on ignored argument using \fBpylint.extensions.docparams\fP
when a function was typed using pep484 but not inside the docstring.
.sp
Closes #4117
Closes #4593
.IP \(bu 2
\fBsetuptools_scm\fP has been removed and replaced by \fBtbump\fP in order to not
have hidden runtime dependencies to setuptools
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a crash when a test function is decorated with \fB@pytest.fixture\fP and astroid can\(aqt
infer the name of the decorator when using \fBopen\fP without \fBwith\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #4612
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBdeprecated\-decorator\fP: Emitted when deprecated decorator is used.
.sp
Closes #4429
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fBignore\-paths\fP behaviour. Defined regex patterns are matched against full file path.
.sp
Closes #2541
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative for \fBconsider\-using\-with\fP if calls like \fBopen()\fP were used outside of assignment expressions.
.IP \(bu 2
The warning for \fBarguments\-differ\fP now signals explicitly the difference it detected
by naming the argument or arguments that changed and the type of change that occurred.
.IP \(bu 2
Suppress \fBconsider\-using\-with\fP inside context managers.
.sp
Closes #4430
.IP \(bu 2
Added \fB\-\-fail\-on\fP option to return non\-zero exit codes regardless of \fB\-\-fail\-under\fP value.
.IP \(bu 2
numversion tuple contains integers again to fix multiple pylint\(aqs plugins that relied on it
.sp
Closes #4420
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false\-positive \fBtoo\-many\-ancestors\fP when inheriting from builtin classes,
especially from the \fBcollections.abc\fP module
.sp
Closes #4166
Closes #4415
.IP \(bu 2
Stdlib deprecated modules check is moved to stdlib checker. New deprecated
modules are added.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix raising false\-positive \fBno\-member\fP on abstract properties
.IP \(bu 2
Created new error message called \fBarguments\-renamed\fP which identifies any changes at the parameter
names of overridden functions.
.sp
Closes #3536
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBconsider\-using\-dict\-items\fP\&. Emitted  when iterating over dictionary keys and then
indexing the same dictionary with the key within loop body.
.sp
Closes #3389
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt emit \fBimport\-error\fP if import guarded behind \fBif sys.version_info >= (x, x)\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Fix incompatibility with Python 3.6.0 caused by \fBtyping.Counter\fP and \fBtyping.NoReturn\fP usage
.sp
Closes #4412
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBuse\-maxsplit\-arg\fP\&. Emitted either when accessing only the first or last
element of \fBstr.split()\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #4440
.IP \(bu 2
Add ignore_signatures to duplicate code checker
.sp
Closes #3619
.IP \(bu 2
Fix documentation errors in \(dqBlock disables\(dq paragraph of User Guide.
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBunnecessary\-dict\-index\-lookup\fP\&. Emitted when iterating over dictionary items
(key\-value pairs) and accessing the value by index lookup.
.sp
Closes #4470
.IP \(bu 2
New checker\(ga\(gaconsider\-using\-from\-import\(ga\(ga. Emitted when a submodule/member of a package is imported and aliased
with the same name.
.sp
Closes #2309
.IP \(bu 2
Allow comma\-separated list in \fBoutput\-format\fP and separate output files for
each specified format.
.sp
Closes #1798
.IP \(bu 2
Make \fBusing\-constant\-test\fP detect constant tests consisting of list literals like \fB[]\fP and
\fB[1, 2, 3]\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Improved error message of \fBunnecessary\-comprehension\fP checker by providing code suggestion.
.sp
Closes #4499
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBunused\-private\-member\fP\&. Emitted when a private member (i.e., starts with \fB__\fP) of a class
is defined but not used.
.sp
Closes #4483
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false negative of \fBconsider\-using\-enumerate\fP when iterating over an attribute.
.sp
Closes #3657
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBinvalid\-class\-object\fP\&. Emitted when a non\-class is assigned to a \fB__class__\fP attribute.
.sp
Closes #585
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a crash when a plugin from the configuration could not be loaded and raise an error
bad\-plugin\-value / E0013 \%<#\:bad-plugin-value>\(aq instead
.sp
Closes #4555
.IP \(bu 2
Added handling of floating point values when parsing configuration from pyproject.toml
.sp
Closes #4518
.IP \(bu 2
\fBinvalid\-length\-returned\fP, now also works when nothing at all is returned
following an upgrade in astroid.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBlogging\-format\-interpolation\fP and \fBlogging\-not\-lazy\fP, now works on logger
class created from renamed logging import following an upgrade in astroid.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false\-positive \fBno\-member\fP with generic base class
.sp
Closes pylint\-dev/astroid#942
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBassigning\-non\-slot\fP false\-positive with base that inherits from \fBtyping.Generic\fP
.sp
Closes #4509
Closes pylint\-dev/astroid#999
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBinvalid\-all\-format\fP\&. Emitted when \fB__all__\fP has an invalid format,
i.e. isn\(aqt a \fBtuple\fP or \fBlist\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive \fBunused\-variable\fP and \fBundefined\-variable\fP with
Pattern Matching in Python 3.10
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBawait\-outside\-async\fP\&. Emitted when await is used outside an async function.
.IP \(bu 2
Clarify documentation for \fBtyping\fP extension.
.sp
Closes #4545
.IP \(bu 2
Add new extension \fBCodeStyleChecker\fP\&. It includes checkers that can improve code
consistency. As such they don\(aqt necessarily provide a performance benefit
and are often times opinionated.
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBconsider\-using\-tuple\fP\&. Emitted when an in\-place defined
list or set can be replaced by a tuple.
.IP \(bu 2
New checker \fBconsider\-using\-namedtuple\-or\-dataclass\fP\&. Emitted when dictionary values
can be replaced by namedtuples or dataclass instances.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix error that occurred when using \fBslice\fP as subscript for dict.
.IP \(bu 2
Reduce false\-positives around inference of \fB\&.value\fP and \fB\&.name\fP
properties on \fBEnum\fP subclasses, following an upgrade in astroid
.sp
Closes #1932
Closes #2062
.IP \(bu 2
Fix issue with \fBcached_property\fP that caused \fBinvalid\-overridden\-method\fP error
when overriding a \fBproperty\fP\&.
.sp
Closes #4023
.IP \(bu 2
Fix \fBunused\-import\fP false positive for imported modules referenced in
attribute lookups in type comments.
.sp
Closes #4603
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New In Pylint 2.8
.sp
From pylint\(aqs beginning to pylint 2.14.0 included, we had a changelog that contained \fIall\fP
nontrivial changes to Pylint, including changes that were
not user facing, i.e. change that might interest you only if you\(aqre a developer
working on pylint or pylint plugins or an open\-source historian.
.sp
From pylint 1.6.0 to 2.14.0, on top of the full changelog there was also a summary
of (mostly user facing) changes.
.SS Summary \-\- Release highlights
.SS Breaking changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
The \(aqdoc\(aq extra\-require has been removed. \fI__pkginfo__\(ga\fP does not contain the package metadata anymore
(except \fBnumversion\fP, until 3.0). Meta\-information are accessible with
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB\(gapython
from importlib import metadata
metadata.metadata(\(aqpylint\(aq)
\(ga\fP
Prefer that to an import from \fB__pkginfo__\fP\&.
.SS New checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New refactoring message \fBconsider\-using\-with\fP\&. This message is emitted if resource\-allocating functions or methods of the
standard library (like \fBopen()\fP or \fBthreading.Lock.acquire()\fP) that can be used as a context manager are called without
a \fBwith\fP block.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBdeprecated\-argument\fP check for deprecated arguments.
.IP \(bu 2
Add new extension \fBConfusingConsecutiveElifChecker\fP\&. This optional checker emits a refactoring message (R5601 \fBconfusing\-consecutive\-elif\fP)
if if/elif statements with different indentation levels follow directly one after the other.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBconsider\-using\-min\-max\-builtin\fP check for if statement which could be replaced by Python builtin min or max.
.IP \(bu 2
Add new extension \fBTypingChecker\fP\&. This optional checker can detect the use of deprecated typing aliases
and can suggest the use of the alternative union syntax where possible.
(For example, \(aqtyping.Dict\(aq can be replaced by \(aqdict\(aq, and \(aqtyping.Unions\(aq by \(aq|\(aq, etc.)
Make sure to check the config options if you plan on using it!
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBdeprecated\-class\fP check for deprecated classes.
.UNINDENT
.SS Other Changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New option \fB\-\-output=<file>\fP to output result to a file rather than printing to stdout.
.sp
Closes #1070
.IP \(bu 2
Reduce usage of blacklist/whitelist terminology. Notably, \fBextension\-pkg\-allow\-list\fP is an
alternative to \fBextension\-pkg\-whitelist\fP and the message \fBblacklisted\-name\fP is now emitted as
\fBdisallowed\-name\fP\&. The previous names are accepted to maintain backward compatibility.
.IP \(bu 2
The packaging is now done via setuptools exclusively. \fBdoc\fP, \fBtests\fP, \fBman\fP, \fBelisp\fP and \fBChangelog\fP are
not packaged anymore \- reducing the size of the package by 75%.
.IP \(bu 2
Updated \fBastroid\fP to 2.5.4
.IP \(bu 2
COPYING has been renamed to LICENSE for standardization.
.UNINDENT
.SS Full changelog
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.8.3?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-05\-31
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Astroid has been pinned to 2.5.6 for the 2.8 branch.
.sp
Refs #4527
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.8.2?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-04\-26
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Keep \fB__pkginfo__.numversion\fP a tuple to avoid breaking pylint\-django.
.sp
Closes #4405
.IP \(bu 2
scm_setuptools has been added to the packaging.
.IP \(bu 2
Pylint\(aqs tags are now the standard form \fBvX.Y.Z\fP and not \fBpylint\-X.Y.Z\fP anymore.
.IP \(bu 2
New warning message \fBdeprecated\-class\fP\&. This message is emitted if import or call deprecated class of the
standard library (like \fBcollections.Iterable\fP that will be removed in Python 3.10).
.sp
Closes #4388
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.8.1?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-04\-25
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Add numversion back (temporarily) in \fB__pkginfo__\fP because it broke Pylama and revert the unnecessary
\fBpylint.version\fP breaking change.
.sp
Closes #4399
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New in Pylint 2.8.0?
.sp
Release date: 2021\-04\-24
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
New refactoring message \fBconsider\-using\-with\fP\&. This message is emitted if resource\-allocating functions or methods of the
standard library (like \fBopen()\fP or \fBthreading.Lock.acquire()\fP) that can be used as a context manager are called without
a \fBwith\fP block.
.sp
Closes #3413
.IP \(bu 2
Resolve false positives on unused variables in decorator functions
.sp
Closes #4252
.IP \(bu 2
Add new extension \fBConfusingConsecutiveElifChecker\fP\&. This optional checker emits a refactoring message (R5601 \fBconfusing\-consecutive\-elif\fP)
if if/elif statements with different indentation levels follow directly one after the other.
.IP \(bu 2
New option \fB\-\-output=<file>\fP to output result to a file rather than printing to stdout.
.sp
Closes #1070
.IP \(bu 2
Use a prescriptive message for \fBunidiomatic\-typecheck\fP
.sp
Closes #3891
.IP \(bu 2
Apply \fBconst\-naming\-style\fP to module constants annotated with
\fBtyping.Final\fP
.IP \(bu 2
The packaging is now done via setuptools exclusively. \fBdoc\fP, \fBtests\fP, \fBman\fP, \fBelisp\fP and \fBChangelog\fP are
not packaged anymore \- reducing the size of the package by 75%.
.IP \(bu 2
Debian packaging is now  (officially) done in \%<https://\:salsa\:.debian\:.org/\:python-team/\:packages/\:pylint>\&.
.IP \(bu 2
The \(aqdoc\(aq extra\-require has been removed.
.IP \(bu 2
\fB__pkginfo__\fP now only contain \fB__version__\fP (also accessible with \fBpylint.__version__\fP), other meta\-information are still
accessible with \fBfrom importlib import metadata;metadata.metadata(\(aqpylint\(aq)\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
COPYING has been renamed to LICENSE for standardization.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false\-positive \fBused\-before\-assignment\fP in function returns.
.sp
Closes #4301
.IP \(bu 2
Updated \fBastroid\fP to 2.5.3
.sp
Closes #2822, #4206, #4284
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBconsider\-using\-min\-max\-builtin\fP check for if statement which could be replaced by Python builtin min or max
.sp
Closes #3406
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt auto\-enable postponed evaluation of type annotations with Python 3.10
.IP \(bu 2
Update \fBastroid\fP to 2.5.4
.IP \(bu 2
Add new extension \fBTypingChecker\fP\&. This optional checker can detect the use of deprecated typing aliases
and can suggest the use of the alternative union syntax where possible.
(For example, \(aqtyping.Dict\(aq can be replaced by \(aqdict\(aq, and \(aqtyping.Unions\(aq by \(aq|\(aq, etc.)
Make sure to check the config options if you plan on using it!
.IP \(bu 2
Reactivates old counts in report mode.
.sp
Closes #3819
.IP \(bu 2
During detection of \fBinconsistent\-return\-statements\fP consider that \fBassert False\fP is a return node.
.sp
Closes #4019
.IP \(bu 2
Run will not fail if score exactly equals \fBconfig.fail_under\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Functions that never returns may declare \fBNoReturn\fP as type hints, so that
\fBinconsistent\-return\-statements\fP is not emitted.
.sp
Closes #4122, #4188
.IP \(bu 2
Improved protected access checks to allow access inside class methods
.sp
Closes #1159
.IP \(bu 2
Fix issue with PEP 585 syntax and the use of \fBcollections.abc.Set\fP
.IP \(bu 2
Fix issue that caused class variables annotated with \fBtyping.ClassVar\fP to be
identified as class constants. Now, class variables annotated with
\fBtyping.Final\fP are identified as such.
.sp
Closes #4277
.IP \(bu 2
Continuous integration with read the doc has been added.
.sp
Closes #3850
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt show \fBDuplicateBasesError\fP for attribute access
.IP \(bu 2
Fix crash when checking \fBsetup.cfg\fP for pylint config when there are non\-ascii characters in there
.sp
Closes #4328
.IP \(bu 2
Allow code flanked in backticks to be skipped by spellchecker
.sp
Closes #4319
.IP \(bu 2
Allow Python tool directives (for black, flake8, zimports, isort, mypy, bandit, pycharm) at beginning of comments to be skipped by spellchecker
.sp
Closes #4320
.IP \(bu 2
Fix issue that caused Emacs pylint to fail when used with tramp
.IP \(bu 2
Improve check for invalid PEP 585 syntax inside functions
if postponed evaluation of type annotations is enabled
.IP \(bu 2
Improve check for invalid PEP 585 syntax as default function arguments
.UNINDENT
.SS What\(aqs New In Pylint 2.7
.sp
From pylint\(aqs beginning to pylint 2.14.0 included, we had a changelog that contained \fIall\fP
nontrivial changes to Pylint, including changes that were
not user facing, i.e. change that might interest you only if you\(aqre a developer
working on pylint or pylint plugins or an open\-source historian.
.sp
From pylint 1.6.0 to 2.14.0, on top of the full changelog there was also a summary
of (mostly user facing) changes.
.SS Summary \-\- Release highlights
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Python 3.6+ is now required.
.IP \(bu 2
No more duplicate messages when using multiple jobs.
.IP \(bu 2
Handling of the new typing provided by mypy 0.8
.IP \(bu 2
Reduced the number of false positives in general
.IP \(bu 2
Reduced the occurrence of genuinely large recursion that went above system limit (See #3836, for a fix for pandas)
.UNINDENT
.SS New checkers
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBnan\-comparison\fP check for comparison of NaN values
.IP \(bu 2
Add support to \fBignored\-argument\-names\fP in DocstringParameterChecker and
adds \fBuseless\-param\-doc\fP and \fBuseless\-type\-doc\fP messages.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBempty\-comment\fP check for empty comments.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBsimplifiable\-condition\fP check for extraneous constants in conditionals using and/or.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBcondition\-evals\-to\-constant\fP check for conditionals using and/or that evaluate to a constant.
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBconsider\-using\-generator\fP check for the use of list comprehension inside \fBany\fP or \fBall\fP function.
.UNINDENT
.SS Other Changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive for \fBbuiltin\-not\-iterating\fP when \fBzip\fP or \fBmap\fP receives iterable
.IP \(bu 2
Fix linter multiprocessing pool shutdown which triggered warnings when ran in parallels with other pytest plugins.
.IP \(bu 2
Enums are now required to be named in UPPER_CASE by \fBinvalid\-name\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix bug that lead to duplicate messages when using \fB\-\-jobs 2\fP or more.
.IP \(bu 2
Adds option \fBcheck\-protected\-access\-in\-special\-methods\fP in the ClassChecker to activate/deactivate
\fBprotected\-access\fP message emission for single underscore prefixed attribute in special methods.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBinconsistent\-return\-statements\fP message is now emitted if one of \fBtry/except\fP statement
is not returning explicitly while the other do.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false positive message \fBuseless\-super\-delegation\fP when default keyword argument is a dictionary.
.IP \(bu 2
Fix vulnerable regular expressions in \fBpyreverse\fP\&. The ambiguities of vulnerable regular expressions are removed, making the repaired regular expressions safer and faster matching.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBlen\-as\-conditions\fP is now triggered only for classes that are inheriting directly from list, dict, or set and not implementing the \fB__bool__\fP function, or from generators like range or list/dict/set comprehension. This should reduce the false positive for other classes, like pandas\(aqs DataFrame or numpy\(aqs Array.
.IP \(bu 2
Fixes duplicate code detection for \-\-jobs=2+
.IP \(bu 2
New option \fBallowed\-redefined\-builtins\fP defines variable names allowed to shadow builtins.
.IP \(bu 2
Improved protected access checks to allow access inside class methods
.UNINDENT
.SS Full changelog
