\fBlen\-as\-conditions\fP is now triggered only for classes that are inheriting directly from list, dict, or set and not implementing the \fB__bool__\fP function, or from generators like range or list/dict/set comprehension. This should reduce the false positives for other classes, like pandas\(aqs DataFrame or numpy\(aqs Array.
