Closes #2984 #3573
.IP \(bu 2
Add \fBsuper\-with\-arguments\fP check for flagging instances of Python 2 style super calls.
.IP \(bu 2
Add an faq detailing which messages to disable to avoid duplicates w/ other popular linters
