.IP \(bu 2
Fix a regression where messages with dash are not fully parsed
.sp
Closes #3604
.IP \(bu 2
In a TOML configuration file, it\(aqs now possible to use rich (non\-string) types, such as list, integer or boolean instead of strings. For example, one can now define a \fIlist\fP of message identifiers to enable like this:
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
enable = [
    \(dquse\-symbolic\-message\-instead\(dq,
    \(dquseless\-suppression\(dq,
]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Closes #3538
.IP \(bu 2
Fix a regression where the score was not reported with multiple jobs
.sp
Closes #3547
