.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix not being able to disable certain messages on the last line through
the global disable option
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Closes #2278
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt emit \fBuseless\-return\fP when we have a single statement that is the return itself
.sp
We still want to be explicit when a function is supposed to return
an optional value; even though \fBpass\fP could still work, it\(aqs not explicit
enough and the function might look like it\(aqs missing an implementation.
.sp
Closes #2300
.IP \(bu 2
Fix false\-positive undefined\-variable / E0602 \%<#\:undefined-variable> for self referential class name in lamdbas
.sp
Closes #704
.IP \(bu 2
Don\(aqt crash when \fBpylint\fP is unable to infer the value of an argument to \fBnext()\fP
